OL,3,GNEWSAChurches to open their doors for
OL,4,Awinter night shelter
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity said it is preparing to run a
OL,7,Fwinter night shelter across a number of
OL,8,Fdifferent churches to house rough
OL,9,Fsleepers in a city.
OL,11,FThe shelter, run by Light Project
OL,12,FPeterborough (LPP), will provide
OL,13,Femergency overnight accommodation
OL,14,Fbetween December and March for people
OL,15,Fsleeping on the streets in
OL,16,FPeterborough.
OL,18,FThe charity said it hoped nine churches
OL,19,Fwould be able to host the shelter for
OL,20,Fone night a week, offering eight beds
OL,21,Ffor those in need.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
